IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fa-families`

-- A New Tax System (Family Assistance) Act 1999, ss 6, 21, 22, 58AA, 61B, 85BA, Sch 1 Parts 1-5 (in part) and Sch 2 cll 1-4, 11, 12 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_a-new-tax-system-family-assistance-act-1999_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Dollar figures: `printed` is the set of rates AS PRINTED in Compilation No. 124. Schedule 4 indexes almost all of them,
-- so no result here is the amount paid in any year. Incomes and hours of care are not given by the scenarios; where a
-- case needs one it is a stated ASSUMPTION. The newborn supplement amount and the CCS taper percentages are formulas
-- missing from the deposit; where a case needs one the figure is HYPOTHETICAL and says so.

